    "raw": "---\nid: \"jesus-not-the-crowd\"\ntitle: \"Jesus, not the crowd\"\nyear: 2015\ncamp: \"CCM15: Jesus > Crowd\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"Jeremiah 23:16\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Jocelyn Victoria\"\nlyricists: \"Jocelyn Victoria\"\ncomposers: \"Jocelyn Victoria\"\nperformers: \"POJ Praise & Worship (CCM15)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified verbatim in CCM15 BOOK.pdf ('LYRICS JESUS NOT THE CROWD JOCELYN VICTORIA').\"\nkey: \"G\"\nkey_verified: false\nkey_note: \"\"\nchord_status: \"lyrics-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files: []\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM15 Camp Booklet (PDF)\"\n    url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Byshw9IUAvMqQU1uXzk3M3BMQVE/view?usp=drivesdk&resourcekey=0-Yg5R0Zry59IeyCfXCKfjrg\"\n---\n\n## Verse 1\nThey say I’m worthless, but for You I am precious  \nThey say all of my flaws, but You see an image of Yours  \nIn Your words, I find my peace  \nSo I turn to You Jesus, not the Crowd\n\n## Verse 2\nThey count all my wrongs, but Your mercy leads me home  \nThey think I’m on my own, but Your spirit calms the storm  \nIn Your Word, I find my peace  \nSo I turn to You Jesus, not the crowd\n\n## Chorus\nYour Words are the eternal truth, unshaken by all the worldly lies  \nI put my faith in You ‘cause Your promises are forever true  \nI live in the name of Jesus and not the crowd  \nI live in the name of Jesus and not the crowd\n\n## Bridge\nJesus, Jesus, not the crowd\n"
