    "raw": "---\nid: \"i-am-free\"\ntitle: \"I am Free\"\nyear: 2018\ncamp: \"CCM18: Prison Break\"\nlanguage: \"Bilingual\"\nscripture: \"2 Corinthians 6:7 • 2 Corinthians 12:9\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Claresta Wijaya\"\nlyricists: \"Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Claresta Wijaya\"\ncomposers: \"Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Claresta Wijaya\"\nperformers: \"POJ Praise & Worship (Recorded Live 25 Mar 2018)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified on official Sounds of Joy YouTube release & CCM18 Camp Song v1 chord chart.\"\nkey: \"C\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Verified in Concert Key C across both POJ Live Demo (~64 BPM, 4/4) and CCM18 Camp Record (no modulation)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCuBvGx0lNE\"\nyoutube_links:\n  - label: \"I am Free — POJ Praise & Worship Live Demo (Key C)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCuBvGx0lNE\"\n  - label: \"I am Free — CCM18 Camp Songwriting Demo (Key C)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OxhyV6OW98g\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"I am Free — POJ Praise & Worship Live Demo, Key C (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/2018-i-am-free-live-demo.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCuBvGx0lNE\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XffYQJRucFKJqbk2CHmbBvhoLI4AlfJy/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"I am Free — CCM18 Camp Song Record, Key C (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/2018-i-am-free-camp-record.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OxhyV6OW98g\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gWntjfm3ADucyjXDNn2pIkb8irzjcJ01/view?usp=drivesdk\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM18 Chords & Lyrics (Camp Song v1)\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/10fOl9EGy3npnNboeaHBjfU6WZMr7vfBHErKPtTmTBTA/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 4  |  6m  5  |  4  |  4m\n\n[4]   [6m]   [5]   [4]   [4m]\n\n## Verse\n> Progression: 1  |  6m  |  4  2m  |  5  ||  1  5/7  |  6m  |  4  2m  |  5\n\n[1]Semua ku jalani sen[6m]diri  \nTanpa [4]sadar, ku [2m]s’makin ter[5]jatuh  \nMenaruh [1]harap [5/7]pada du[6m]nia  \nTer[4]sesat tanpa [2m]arah tuju[5]an\n\n## Pre-Chorus\n> Progression: 6m  3m  |  4  5  1  |  6m  3m  |  4  5\n\nNamun se[6m]lalu [3m]ada, [4]Kasih yang a[5]badi, [1]  \nSe[6m]lalu meng[3m]ingatku [4]sampai akhir hidup[5]ku\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  3M  |  4  2m  |  1/3  4  |  5  ||  1/3  3M  |  6m  5  4#dim  |  2m  1/3  |  4  5  1\n\nHis [1]Grace is e[3M]nough for me  \nHis [4]Power made me [2m]perfect in [1/3]all my [4]weaknesses [5]  \nHis [1/3]Grace washed a[3M]way my [6m]sin [5]  \nMy [4#dim]soul has been redeemed now  \n(My [2m]sins have been for[1/3]given)  \n(My [4]life has been re[5]newed, For)  \nHis [2m]endless [1/3]love has [4]set [5]me [1]free\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 4  |  1/3  |  2m  |  5  (x2)\n\n[4]   [1/3]   [2m]   [5]\n\n## Bridge\n> Progression: 4  1/3  |  6m  5  |  4  1/3  |  5  1/3  ||  4  1/3  |  6m  2m  |  1/3  |  b7  5\n\nMy [4]chains are [1/3]broken  \nYour [6m]light shines with[5]in me  \nWhen I’m [4]weak, then [1/3]I am strong  \nI’ll [5]trust in You a[1/3]lone  \nAnd [4]now that [1/3]I am freed  \nI will [6m]use my life to [2m]worship You  \nThrough [1/3]every season  \nUn[b7]til the end of [5]time\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 4  |  6m  5  |  4  |  4m  |  1\n\n[4]   [6m]   [5]   [4]   [4m]   [1]\n"
