    "raw": "---\nid: \"cerminan-mu\"\ntitle: \"Cerminan-Mu\"\nyear: 2019\ncamp: \"CCM19: Mirror\"\nlanguage: \"Indonesian\"\nscripture: \"1 Peter 2:21 • 2 Corinthians 3:18\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista\"\nlyricists: \"Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista\"\ncomposers: \"Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista\"\nperformers: \"POJ Praise & Worship (Original Key E, also played in D)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified verbatim in CCM19 Mirror camp_booklet.\"\nkey: \"E\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Original Key E (2019-03-31 live mix, ~136 BPM); also played in D (2019-03-24 live mixes, ~142 BPM) and C (Nathan demo v02)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkSXn_El_IU\"\nyoutube_links:\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — POJ PW Live Mix 2019-03-31 (Key E)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkSXn_El_IU\"\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — POJ PW Band Mix 2019-03-24 (Key D)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l461NQsJwiQ\"\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — Nathan Arrangement Demo v02 (Key C)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XYYe6JqN9vY\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — POJ PW Live Mix 2019-03-31, Key E (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/CCM19-MirrorSong1-Cerminan-Mu-POJPW20190331.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jkSXn_El_IU\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nVHhAQPx5wPi1xtQCpDOhJmiEmayicaJ/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — POJ PW Band Mix 2019-03-24 Take 1, Key D (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/2019-cerminan-mu-band.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l461NQsJwiQ\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YtV1JZZnqs4NhOAG3u_dljLb3BaxP075/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — POJ PW Live Mix 2019-03-24 Take 2, Key D (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/CCM19-MirrorSong1-Cerminan-Mu-POJPW20190324-2.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"\"\n    drive_url: \"\"\n  - label: \"Cerminan-Mu — Nathan Arrangement Demo v02, Key C (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/2019-cerminan-mu-arr-nathan.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XYYe6JqN9vY\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-6QH48gLZPsAQgPrAQEFSlpk7G9c9qW7/view?usp=drivesdk\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM19 Mirror Booklet (Credits)\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eSFe4fzqYxspaHlkQsAH-FE-O_1Nt7-W_aDhcm3wumc/edit\"\n  - label: \"CCM19 Chords & Lyrics\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PkjfLRql8PY-37mOhKzZsrcjjoJ1cQKXlUiP1ENMz5s/edit\"\n  - label: \"CCM19 PW Camp Schedule\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MYR3xWqvtZYxoaybsp_bon7eu67_EOkI68LPgkbPC7E/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 1  |  1  |  1  |  1  (x2)\n\n[1]\n\n## Verse\n> Progression: 1  |  2m  |  4  |  4  ||  6m  |  5  |  4  |  4\n\n[1]Kita Dipanggil tuk nya[2m]takan Kemuliaan [4]Nya  \ndan [6m]Memberitakan [5]sgala perbu[4]atan Nya  \n[1]Ikuti JejakNya karna [2m]Dialah teladan [4]Kita  \n[6m]Hidup se[5]rupa dengan [4]gambaranNya\n\n## Pre-Chorus\n> Progression: 5  |  6m  |  4  |  4  ||  5  |  6m  |  b7  |  b7  |  5  |  5\n\n[5]Dia Yesus mende[6m]rita tebus s'gala [4]dosa kita  \n[5]KuasaNya telah menga[6m]lahkan maut, [b7]membebaskan [5]kita\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  2m  |  4  |  4  ||  6m  |  5  |  4  |  4  ||  1  |  2m  |  4  |  4  ||  6m  |  5  |  4  |  5\n\n[1]Sorak dan Tinggi[2m]kan, \"Yesus [4]Raja Mulia\"  \n[6m]Angkatlah ta[5]nganmu, Mari [4]Puji NamaNya  \n[1]Jadilah pe[2m]lita, menyi[4]nari dunia  \n[6m]Pancarkan kebe[5]naran sebagai [4]Cerminan [5]KasihNya\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 1  |  1  |  2m  |  2m  |  6m  |  6m  |  4  |  4\n\n[1]   [2m]   [6m]   [4]\n\n## Bridge\n> Progression: 4  |  4  |  6m  |  5  ||  4  |  4  |  6m  |  1  ||  4  |  4  |  6m  |  5  ||  4  |  4  |  6m  |  1  ||  4  |  4  |  5  |  5\n\n[4]Kita kan Jadi Cer[6m]minan Gamba[5]ranMu  \n[4]Membuka jalan kebe[6m]naran dan [1]hidup  \n[4]Biarlah Dunia meli[6m]hat dan sak[5]sikan  \n[4]Allah yang hebat hidup [6m]di dalam [1]kita  \n([4]Hidup di dalam [5]kita)\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 1  |  1  |  2m  |  2m  |  6m  |  6m  |  4  |  4  |  1\n\n[1]   [2m]   [6m]   [4]   [1]\n"
