    "raw": "---\nid: \"embraced\"\ntitle: \"Embraced\"\nyear: 2019\ncamp: \"CCM19: Mirror\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"1 Peter 2:21 • Romans 8:38–39\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista, Arian Prabowo\"\nlyricists: \"Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista, Arian Prabowo\"\ncomposers: \"Clarissa Tedy Angelita, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Claudia Lee, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Phoebe Calista, Arian Prabowo\"\nperformers: \"POJ Praise & Worship (Original Key D; 2019-03-10 Rehearsal in G)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified verbatim in CCM19 Mirror camp_booklet.\"\nkey: \"D\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Original Key D major (~64 BPM, 4/4; verified in Full Band Mix, Demos & CCM19 Schedule; 2019-03-10 PW rehearsal in G)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yQ1Rtk5YlU\"\nyoutube_links:\n  - label: \"Embraced — Studio Instrumental Guide (Key D)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yQ1Rtk5YlU\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — Acoustic Vocal Demo v02 (Key D)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avnhdTnBdrA\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — Early Duet Demo v01 (Key D)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYJTa64AUu8\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — Live Rehearsal 2019-03-10 (Key G)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kN43n_b-evQ\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"Embraced POJ — Full Band Mix, Key D (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/Embraced POJ.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yQ1Rtk5YlU\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YfmjvZnM0xiRuc0duxP4KbjkxVG3r9vR/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — CCM19 Mirror Demo v02, Key D (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/2019-embraced-demo-v02.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=avnhdTnBdrA\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YrcZx73tAgOSGmBbPG2nG6_4LuLH9F9P/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — CCM19 Mirror Demo v01, Key D (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/2019-embraced-demo-v01.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYJTa64AUu8\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hXDtD-H5R7o_MeMby2phrM73o5tmnU9z/view?usp=drivesdk\"\n  - label: \"Embraced — POJ PW Rehearsal 2019-03-10, Key G (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/CCM19-Mirror-Song2-POJPW20190310.mp3\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kN43n_b-evQ\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cgXGpiWh_0uKBWICFMKE6Ywfb2NznYQp/view?usp=drivesdk\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM19 Mirror Booklet (Credits)\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eSFe4fzqYxspaHlkQsAH-FE-O_1Nt7-W_aDhcm3wumc/edit\"\n  - label: \"CCM19 Lyrics Doc\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Pu0SARB_shPSS554-Lsbg9rkKLiNJx7kP69XCfHdS4g/edit\"\n  - label: \"CCM19 PW Camp Schedule\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1MYR3xWqvtZYxoaybsp_bon7eu67_EOkI68LPgkbPC7E/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 1  |  4  |  6m  |  4  ||  1  |  4  |  6m  |  4\n\n[1]   [4]   [6m]   [4]  \n[1]   [4]   [6m]   [4]\n\n## Verse 1\n> Progression: 1  2m  1/3  |  4  |  2m  1/3  |  4  5\n\n[1]Grace, [2m]fill the [1/3]empty [4]void  \n[2m]Lift me up to the [1/3]heaven  \nLet the [4]spirit lead me [5]home\n\n## Verse 2\n> Progression: 1  2m  1/3  |  4  |  2m  1/3  |  4  5\n\n[1]Love, [2m]you have [1/3]seen me [4]through  \n[2m]Constant through the [1/3]seasons  \n[4]Faithful through the [5]ages\n\n## Pre-Chorus\n> Progression: 6m  5/7  |  1  4  |  6m  5  |  4  ||  6m  5/7  |  1  4  |  6m  5  |  4  |  4\n\nMy [6m]strength, my [5/7]hope, and my [1]strong foun[4]dation  \nLet me [6m]be the [5]vessel of Your [4]power\n\n[6m]Saviour, Re[5/7]deemer, Ever[1]lasting [4]Father  \nLet my [6m]life be the [5]wonder of Your [4]works\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  4  |  6m  5  |  4  ||  1  |  4  |  6m  5  |  4\n\nYou [1]pulled me out of the deep water  \nYou [4]calmed the storm before my eyes  \nYou [6m]came into my [5]life and make me [4]whole again\n\n[1]Guided me through the darkest valley  \n[4]Lit up the path unto my feet  \n[6m]I will not fear for I [5]know that you are [4]with me\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 1  |  2m  |  6m  |  4\n\n[1]   [2m]   [6m]   [4]\n\n## Bridge\n> Progression: 1  |  2m  |  6m  |  4  ||  4  |  5  |  3m  |  6m  5\n\nAs I [1]brace for the waters  \nAs I [2m]walk through the fire  \nAs I [6m]face against the darkness  \nYou em[4]braced me through it all\n\nNeither [4]waves nor flames  \nNeither [5]height nor depth  \nNeither [3m]death nor life  \nWill [6m]cast away Your [5]love from me\n\n## Final Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  4  |  6m  5  |  4  ||  1  |  4  |  6m  5  |  4  ||  6m  5  |  4  |  6m  5  |  4\n\nYou [1]pulled me out of the deep water  \nYou [4]calmed the storm before my eyes  \nYou [6m]came into my [5]life and make me [4]whole again\n\n[1]Guided me through the darkest valley  \n[4]Lit up the path unto my feet  \n[6m]I will not fear for I [5]know that you are [4]with me\n\nI'll [6m]trust and follow [5]You wherever You [4]send me  \n[6m]All of my days, I [5]long to be with you my [4]Lord\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 1  |  4  |  6m  |  4  |  1\n\n[1]   [4]   [6m]   [4]   [1]\n"
