    "raw": "---\nid: \"sesuai-dengan-rencana-mu\"\ntitle: \"Sesuai Dengan Rencana-Mu\"\nyear: 2021\ncamp: \"CCM21: Uno\"\nlanguage: \"Indonesian\"\nscripture: \"\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Claudia Lesmana, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Phoebe Calista, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Eril Levana, Valentina Trisha\"\nlyricists: \"Claudia Lesmana, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Phoebe Calista, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Eril Levana, Valentina Trisha\"\ncomposers: \"Claudia Lesmana, Hans Anastasius Kurniawan, Phoebe Calista, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Eril Levana, Valentina Trisha\"\nperformers: \"Phoebe Calista (Piano), Josiah Abiezer (Bass), Vivi Anggara (Vocal), Samantha Sutiono (Vocal), Hans Anastasius (Vocal, AG)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified on official Living Room Session YouTube release & CCM Easter 2021 Handbook.\"\nkey: \"D\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Original Key D major (~68 BPM, 4/4 Living Room Session)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fB3XJ1doDZk\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files: []\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM Easter 2021 Handbook\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1k55FJPlVJE7OOsoTcgfjor5ZBZ0LQ_fC-LGLcwLKmsk/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 1  |  4  4m6  |  1  |  4  4m6\n\n[1]   [4] [4m6]   [1]   [4] [4m6]\n\n## Verse\n> Progression: 1  5/7  |  6m7  4  |  1  5  |  6m7  4  ||  1  5/7  |  6m7  4  |  1  5  |  6m7  4  5\n\n[1]Kau turun ke du[5/7]nia  \nTuk [6m7]tebus segala [4]dosa  \nMen[1]jadi Manu[5]sia  \nTuk pu[6m7]lihkanku [4]\n\nMe[1]ninggalkan tah[5/7]ta-Mu  \nTuk da[6m7]patkan hati[4]ku  \nMen[1]jadi Manu[5]sia  \nyang ber[6m7]harga di [4]mata-[5]Mu\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4  |  1/3  |  5  |  6m7  |  4  ||  1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4  |  1/3  |  5  |  6m7  |  4\n\n[1]Inilah Hi[5/7]dupku  \nSe[6m7]utuhnya di [4]TanganMu  \nPa[1/3]kailah di[5]riku  \nSesu[6m7]ai dengan ren[4]canaMu\n\n[1]Inilah Ha[5/7]tiku  \nSe[6m7]luruhnya [4]MilikMu  \nPa[1/3]kailah di[5]riku  \nNyata[6m7]kan Kemuli[4]aanMu\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4\n\n[1]   [5/7]   [6m7]   [4]\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 6m7  |  4  |  1/3  |  5  |  1\n\n[6m7]   [4]   [1/3]   [5]   [1]"
