    "file": "songs/2024-my-declaration.md",
    "raw": "---\nid: \"my-declaration\"\ntitle: \"My Declaration\"\nyear: 2024\ncamp: \"CCM24: New Wine\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"Matthew 9:17\"\ncredits: \"POJ CCM24 Praise & Worship Songwriting Team\"\nlyricists: \"POJ CCM24 Praise & Worship Songwriting Team\"\ncomposers: \"POJ CCM24 Praise & Worship Songwriting Team\"\nperformers: \"POJ CCM24 PW Team (Jorryn Nathaniel, Gerry Christian, Josiah Abiezer, Hans Anastasius, Jennifer Hartono, Nathan Prajogo Djuanda, Jane Vieren Anggani, Alice Aurelia Santoso, Carine Natarina, Chrisiella Soeryawinata, Farrel Sihite)\"\ncredit_note: \"Camp PW roster verified in Handbook Easter Camp 2024; contact arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au to specify individual songwriters.\"\nkey: \"D\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Original Key D major (~72 BPM, 4/4; verified from CCM24 acoustic duet demo)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YyvTkcAXyBo\"\nyoutube_links:\n  - label: \"My Declaration — CCM24 Acoustic Duet Demo (Key D)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YyvTkcAXyBo\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"My Declaration — CCM24 Acoustic Duet Demo, Key D (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/AUD-20261112-WA0023.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YyvTkcAXyBo\"\n    drive_url: \"\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM Easter Camp 2024 Handbook\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uEauxcnzY_7SVrw61T3azMGYpJwJrAavPDPT8UGyD-4/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 4  |  1  |  4  |  1\n\n[4]   [1]   [4]   [1]\n\n## Verse 1\n> Progression: 4  |  1  |  4  |  6m7  5  ||  4  |  1  6m7  |  4  2m7  |  5sus4  5\n\nAll the [4]times You picked me up when [1]I'm lost  \nFor the [4]time You saved my life, de[6m7]spite all [5]the cost  \nFor all my [4]sins You washed away on [1]the [6m7]cross  \nYour [4]grace has made a [2m7]way  \nAnd [5sus4]He will make a [5]way\n\n## Verse 2\n> Progression: 4  |  1  |  4  |  6m7  5  ||  4  5  |  1/3  6m7  |  4  2m7  |  5sus4  5\n\nFor[4]ever I will hold unto Your [1]right hand  \nAnd [4]I will always run unto Your [6m7]unend[5]ing Love  \nThough the [4]seasons [5]change, You're [1/3]still [6m7]the same  \nOh [4]Lord, [2m7]I trust in [5sus4]You [5]\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  1  |  6m7  |  6m7  |  4  |  1  |  4  2m7  |  5  ||  1  |  1  |  6m7  |  6m7  |  4  |  1  |  4  2m7  |  5  1\n\nThe [1]world could give all its presents  \n[6m7]Nothing compares to Your presence  \nTo Your [4]arms I'll run  \nLike the [1]prodigal son  \n[4]I'm all [2m7]Yours  \nAll my [5sus4]life is [5]Yours\n\n[1]You are the Savior of my soul  \n[6m7]With You I'm finally whole  \nBy Your [4]grace alone  \n[1]None of my own  \n[4]I'm all [2m7]Yours  \nAll my [5]life is [1]Yours\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 4  |  1  |  4  |  5\n\n[4]   [1]   [4]   [5]\n\n## Bridge\n> Progression: 4  |  1  |  5  |  1  ||  4  |  1  |  5  |  1  (x2)\n\nWith [4]everything I am  \nAnd [1]everything I have  \nI will [5]give You praise  \nI'm [1]all Yours  \nLet my [4]every step  \nAnd my [1]every breath  \nLift Your [5]name on high  \nI'm [1]all Yours\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 1  |  4  |  5  |  1\n\n[1]   [4]   [5]   [1]\n"
