    "raw": "---\nid: \"within\"\ntitle: \"Within\"\nyear: 2025\ncamp: \"CCM25: Within\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"Isaiah 61:1–7\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Jane Vieren Anggani, Alicia Jeanelly Pasa Nugroho, Farrel Sihite, Gerald Wiranata, Alice Aurelia Santoso, Steven\"\nlyricists: \"Jane Vieren Anggani, Alicia Jeanelly Pasa Nugroho, Farrel Sihite, Gerald Wiranata, Alice Aurelia Santoso, Steven\"\ncomposers: \"Jane Vieren Anggani, Alicia Jeanelly Pasa Nugroho, Farrel Sihite, Gerald Wiranata, Alice Aurelia Santoso, Steven\"\nperformers: \"POJ Praise & Worship (CCM25 Within)\"\ncredit_note: \"Songwriters verified for CCM25 Within (Jane Vieren Anggani, Alicia Jeanelly Pasa Nugroho, Farrel Sihite, Gerald Wiranata, Alice Aurelia Santoso, Steven).\"\nkey: \"Db\"\nkey_verified: true\nkey_note: \"Original Concert Key Db major (~70 BPM, 4/4; Capo 1 play C shapes on acoustic vocal demo)\"\nchord_status: \"chords-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LxArzvxL26Q\"\nyoutube_links:\n  - label: \"Within — CCM25 Acoustic Guitar & Vocal Demo (Key Db)\"\n    url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LxArzvxL26Q\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"Within — CCM25 Acoustic Guitar & Vocal Demo, Key Db (M4A)\"\n    path: \"audio/AUD-20250326-WA0004.m4a\"\n    youtube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LxArzvxL26Q\"\n    drive_url: \"\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM Easter Camp 2025 Handbook\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-uJMm3X3bBd_81kVpw2_YUFxNr1YAJpG9Wntqb4M-rU/edit\"\n  - label: \"Within 25 Planning Tracker\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19VNcFPw4WKTCI31vFULpIc87V-9tgtZ32oR7Nv9OMaQ/edit\"\n---\n\n## Intro\n> Progression: 1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4\n\n[1]   [5/7]   [6m7]   [4]\n\n## Verse 1\n> Progression: 1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4  ||  1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  4\n\n[1]I was lost  \nAnd [5/7]You found me here  \nWhen [6m7]I go far  \nYou [4]draw so near\n\n[1]When I am weary  \n[5/7]You restore my soul  \nI [6m7]will never run on empty  \nYour [4]mercy and love overflows\n\n## Chorus\n> Progression: 1  |  5  |  6m7  3m7  |  4  ||  1  |  5  |  6m7  3m7  |  4\n\nHoly [1]Spirit,  \nCome and [5]move within us  \n[6m7]Fill up this room with Your [3m7]fire  \nAnd [4]make us whole again\n\nPour out Your [1]Spirit  \nWe [5]long for Your presence  \n[6m7]All we need is [3m7]You  \nSo [4]Spirit lead me through\n\n## Interlude\n> Progression: 1  |  5  |  6m7  |  4\n\n[1]   [5]   [6m7]   [4]\n\n## Bridge\n> Progression: 1  |  5/7  |  6m7  |  2m7  4  5  ||  1/3  |  6m7  |  2m7  |  5\n\n[1]Spirit,  \nPour Your a[5/7]nointing on us,  \nU[6m7]nite us in Your love  \nWe're [2m7]Your people  \nWe are Your [4]chosen,  \nAll for Your [5]kingdom.\n\n[1/3]Come now,  \nWe want to lift You up high,  \nWe'll [6m7]praise You forever as in Heaven.  \nWe're Your be[2m7]loved  \nAll for Your [5]kingdom\n\n[1]Oh   [5]Oh   [6m7]Oh   [4]\n\n## Outro\n> Progression: 1  |  5  |  6m7  |  4  |  1\n\n[1]   [5]   [6m7]   [4]   [1]\n"
